{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c12e9d745bf0065e90d150d524a89d6/2026-11/006_0_7.png\"/><p>柴灣一間「雜物屋」發現屍體。今日（24日）晚上7時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其66歲妻子在柴灣翠樂邨翠祿樓的寓所內暈倒，昏迷不醒，救援人員趕到現場，證實女子當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定， 警方將案件暫列「屍體發現」處理。</p><p>據了解，現場堆滿雜物，屋內剩餘的空間不多，當時女事主被困在單位內的走廊，不能動彈。</p><img alt=\"涉事單位外擺放大量雜物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daa801517433f1366b13eb522fe08d61/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_20_40_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1aa6b29bb24190c1640e593dc8a235e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_20_39_59_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為柴灣翠樂邨。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7cba4052f8836f0a94dcec0b67d4f56/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_20_39_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為柴灣翠樂邨。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6a87fb99c4f758b77071042fca14d75/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_20_40_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方暫時將案件列作「屍體發現」。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5dd9046d5a390fc8fb89dc23ad3bd6c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_20_39_59.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:03:59.794484+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T13:17:26.749083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:57:30.213633+00:00","content_hash":"6ef872af6744a0e0b1c4895d3cf75ed916e5683ef04842977bbf6b8648832555","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}